      "widgets_values": [
        "Denoiser: GPU 0. Encoder and both VAEs: GPU 1. Staged component placement, not tensor parallelism. Base schedule: res_multistep / simple, 20 steps, CFG-free, native shifts 12 / 3, seed 42. Short validation draft: 608 x 352, 39 frames at 24 fps (1.625 seconds). 17k+5 frame grid. No Turbo LoRA is installed. Larger resolutions and 124+ frame runs need separate validation."
